          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ઊમટવું — ūmaṭvũ — \"to pour in; to throng (of people)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "આખા શહેરમાંથી લોકો મદદ લઈને ઊમટ્યા. ākhā śahermā̃thī loko madad laīne ūmaṭyā. People poured in from all over the city, bringing help."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (it …): તે ટોળું ઊમટ્યું, te ṭoḷũ ūmaṭyũ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ઊમટવું (ūmaṭvũ) probably goes back to Sanskrit únmṛṣṭa, \"rubbed off\", and so \"made clear\": CDIAL lists Gujarati umaṭvũ, \"to appear, come to light\", there (CDIAL 2133). The sense of crowds that ઊમટે છે, pour out all at once, is the modern language's."
            }
          ]
        },
